  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a663a4b826147e399d8f5079",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "とっておきの魔法、見せてあげるっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "502a0e96335e019b390fdd7e1cdb7aa8b12f7cde3a13096a97b414c2a8def43c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ea505346485ee31721faea8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やだやだやだ～！かわりなんかないもん！\r\nずっと心に決めたものがあるの！\r\n想い描いてた魔女に、なるんだから…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b31d67d9f5c220f36d4beb7fe829a5611e2056ebc37e39e116f46d65bb3843b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:551b52609e33c4f76dbf3897",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "えっ、ウミネコって猫じゃないの？\r\n…使い魔にしてオーディション\r\n手伝わせようと思ってたのに～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41ea3376a2227802c0071aa16e967b3dd146510a1049829ab1735376a2d72b54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "400081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c819a3a2f766b5c63f0137a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一闪一闪・亮晶晶☆\r\n变成一场出色的演唱会吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a45e5db6c44c9be25abfd673d19e588399851884ea1765bf520ef421fc4fc4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dc55a11a6e7fd3950f11ca0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要将Sweepy的歌唱魔法，\r\n传达给大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03d031e498dd2eaad4ff55a0aed533d6ac504962005655ffe246fc89dc5de08b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb8359d634fbbfcb2fb9616",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会把你当作使魔狠狠使唤的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "538886812da5e8a53085381a544d1edec99e64d7989389027ac362643402a734",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b01373134f6bf6795b8b8cdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "魔法少女果然要有使魔！\r\n你以后也要一直为我效力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "479ef88674d8a757e400bed14121faddca1b26507e667ed18a4d565ce345806d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b87212f92bd20d226ef3672",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服穿起来也不错呢。\r\n魔法少女需要有一个伪装的身份♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "72d81c95c54c048f5c0a3a6d322163a25eecc8aecf958840e4f25fb28ed9d3e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93115ab1f697a6a57ed969a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件轻飘飘的衣服很有魔法少女的\r\n感觉吧！帽子也很搭，我很喜欢呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24eadd01d0e7ed09385316e4e314e595c719f93e7b1cf8c26c208a4dbae5a677",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c24d77dba2ef3017c03920d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论怎么看我都是魔法少女对吧？\r\n不管什么对手都会被我用魔法秒杀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "38b89d104f0d8f22029076fef8dfdc89b11c7c55130d4b0b6eba83970065630f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d27c90f1ca7c15ec5aa6586c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～果然还是觉得少了什么！\r\n我想再披一件帅气的披风！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3c4202b4b6f95720fa274b5ef32ca07766b8e9ba70ff76524c78f371a385d7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73c491a865c6de9b823d7bf8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咏唱让自己变闪耀的咒语……\r\n然后，用唱歌和跳舞让人迷上我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4592d98316f051bb25f94edcab4f04ecf921314d7cff94eadca5e65766842683",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dac51c6920fb149a38a24d58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服上施展了最强的魔法♪\r\n无论何时都能为Sweepy带来勇气！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5da7634bf7068b1d637ef3593c985e70afddc5cb05cf657d9fd7c932906cc959",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8427c1fa02df112842a61599",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふっ♪スイーピーにうっとりしちゃった？",
      "source_fingerprint": "28ab87d3e89720d31d702c951c7df101382b54645f9534e799534113715b4870",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f322986ce31a23274b82c262",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もー！早くほめないと怒るわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3a7a214af7412c0ea92788b2251aea407e573ddc30fff10c9aaa423b06fcf7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:771c912e5fdd261698060638",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一闪一闪・亮晶晶☆\r\nSweepy变身！怎么样？很可爱吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9306c15c6e7ec1f11b98feddaee004e35996a180f97dd4a30269422a77572db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b1248f7e6189439eee91325",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚点传衣服的照片给祖母看吧！\r\n她一定会不断称赞我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fef05a177b25af935da8eba2d0ddce0c4d20265575b2a13c7eb82c0fb326113",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0ee03307e23b0c8b777f741",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "魔力を溜めるにはこの服がいいのよ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "570d41b065c44f8e0e839001bc4f19f60afad9769c1aa27569d4ce06cc9f0921",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce77a2cc360ebb8bffc98a06",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "使い魔ならアタシを見習って、\r\n服にも気を使いなさい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "58164639f327895cae934ff2dd501e0e7d50a13fd73fa90a32d9eabeaed71140",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e036ab88b136f2758d38b23",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服穿起来也不错呢。\r\n魔法少女需要有一个伪装的身份♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "72d81c95c54c048f5c0a3a6d322163a25eecc8aecf958840e4f25fb28ed9d3e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
