      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件轻飘飘的衣服很有魔法少女的\r\n感觉吧！帽子也很搭，我很喜欢呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24eadd01d0e7ed09385316e4e314e595c719f93e7b1cf8c26c208a4dbae5a677",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
