      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:198f0c66aecf62ecd44f89cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もー！早くほめないと怒るわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3a7a214af7412c0ea92788b2251aea407e573ddc30fff10c9aaa423b06fcf7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72eb7bc29839d8a21dedec73",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一闪一闪・亮晶晶☆\r\nSweepy变身！怎么样？很可爱吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9306c15c6e7ec1f11b98feddaee004e35996a180f97dd4a30269422a77572db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf76045d6ff312ae3e9eb41b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚点传衣服的照片给祖母看吧！\r\n她一定会不断称赞我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fef05a177b25af935da8eba2d0ddce0c4d20265575b2a13c7eb82c0fb326113",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1af5780aab7d78fd161e2f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:449101375010a7a2322b63d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出现了呢！\r\n就由我天才魔法少女Sweepy\r\n来对付你吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eba3f43ef8358bf33ce5b991831bad91e3ee92f0d13b48209f1f9cc6fab3a740",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e56dd0f2b6f989b06fa5c417",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜负接下来才要开始呢！\r\nSweepy还有很厉害的咒语\r\n没使用……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1dc259c94cdf9b25a9361d13947e31e675f982e5d1e8370e1859e0f00eb423d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9f34f97a397a1f0217f71e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "魔女的一天从魔法开始！\r\n一闪一闪・亮晶晶☆\r\n让今天变成愉快的一天♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e678f93357400e10bfd7300d1329f96267e6dd2d9f2160e3ae8f2919006f049c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fb18e90f44e066def3d7486",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼啊……魔女都是晚上活动，\r\n所以早上很难清醒……\r\n使魔，代替我去上课～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8354981a190cda073901bb5bea3186a053e5d3d3e34f9c74410397427f527d83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c64287a7565107f99d06eca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "餐厅的阿姨绝对是魔女！\r\n她看见剩菜时散发的魄力……\r\n一看就知道是狠角色！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aca9b5d24815e1fe207c82dd6d11b99fd2b4150513d81494db4f89e25cbdd2da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9447a9bc8ab7968ba117130",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鸢尾花・繁星花☆\r\n把上课时间变成睡午觉时间吧！\r\n……好，今天应该会有效！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2d965122c4f89b4ba61a5e4b80df618064eab23c3d8634e98d6ae3a7486396d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0853fb035b0322eae9cb975",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要不要！我还不要回去～！\r\n我要在月光下继续练习魔法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "33b78a3e24cc95a375d5094bb036beb48047d11b1446e1ce62ddb8a980d55560",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dd5cbe1f3f3fe4eb6d24e60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "魔、魔女才不会怕鬼呢！\r\n我说的是真的！\r\n我晚上敢一个人去上厕所……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a6f9e422f9d90ad6ce40cd7597e8aca58c83e4e715e14d4d0f9f71e9cfc382a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18a76b194375da002812f08a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天的魔女住在太阳上。\r\n她会用温暖的魔法让花盛开！\r\n你原本不知道吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "362922be48d67e3b72492d41e6e24e13c2603d5518f21c99c42c4155025da2b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19131e351a5c088ffd3bdd5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜～早知道就先让祖母\r\n教我能驱散热气的咒语，\r\n或是能做出冰块的咒语……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e2e6d0a2b6c93b58bbcb6c573172d91fd6bc59d68cf81967a6892be3b7987c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5965412620ae2fd8e66bff8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到秋天就会想到魔法！\r\n我要施展祖母亲自传授我的\r\n烤番薯魔法，你也一起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a138bff25344ce44a8b4dbbe310501468a4dc5eb30513027e7ecbbd68c63095",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ff0745c0462da8a5b4f1ae0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天禁止在外面训练～！\r\n天气太冷了，\r\n就连热呼呼的暖暖包魔法也会失效！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29f9ae18de2c91897f6ca75c40229fed37b61fc1fc4233ed561076e81ea20262",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37963a236c5719c3285b1552",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "見て見て！ドレス、とってもキレイ\r\nに着られたわ！すごいでしょ～！\r\nアタシはなんでもできるんだから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c50fe9320ea6982e94734623dea9235616f02fefa045b53f84e7f0d3c1988c8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc744f8f234f58f084d2bac2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ほら、朝食にポーション作ったの！\r\n今回は上手くいったはずよ！\r\nなによその顔…早く飲んでってば！",
      "source_fingerprint": "baaac932c6f8c5cb3b1e3286894b636f1ac10ffaa4c5926aaafa6aa19eb8a47e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55023cf35349b97b95a32119",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "も～！スープがドレスに跳ねた～！\r\nなんとかしてってば～！\r\n落ちなかったら使い魔のせいよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7674b17bbce7efff35b8274daa7daf8b184a4ee0760924cb86cd0ec714fb8440",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89bc5a0298d0bdc8f98d17cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…ふわぁ…お腹いっぱいでも、眠く\r\nならない魔法をかけたわ…んん…\r\nきっと…効くんだから…ぐぅ…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a2d0e09b9c0077a9cef50525f7469ad8a0fef3397697acef5702a16d12f3ef0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54bafd3ff8348f88c023fb48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好きな夢を見る魔法を覚えたわ！\r\nだから、箒で空も飛び放題よ！絶対\r\nお月さまに触ってやるんだから！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba689db8bb720a725eaaa8fc641af4402903c6383bb88e59315e685412d39d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb88dac9ff3847d73206ad0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "い～や～だ～！今日はこれ着たまま\r\n寝るの～！夜はパジャマじゃなきゃ\r\nダメなんて、だれが決めたのよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13c697cb4cff00e2f0473f031a552b5cb765e70cc45553c9c5937fbfd66b1aa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b0c06475ea4a1622877caa4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春はお花が咲くから、薬草には\r\n困らないわね！いっぱい摘むから\r\nアンタも手伝いなさい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69719e8fdf5c630e8f9d4a8e6319359ba983b759dca3f695849f14b30cd31810",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e2a1f7981e506fc71e89130",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あ～つ～い～！もっと涼しいとこで\r\n過ごしたいわ！学園を北海道に\r\n瞬間移動させる魔法とかないの！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "786ffb19ad0bdf8429951a3284df5059c12b18a609d6e9725adef8dd4ebdeef5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:587e89db8764d1634915b4fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋だから、いっぱい本を借りたの。\r\nぜんぶ読んだのよ、偉いでしょ？\r\n使い魔、あとで返しておいて！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bcbf97179b8f93405f323bd40e7e972309423fbb57eb306b7dd73a506e8a3e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a63f8b60479216b0d2bcbdd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…ねえ、使い魔。アンタが着てる\r\n上着、とっても暖かそうね？…もう\r\nわかるでしょ？ね？わかるわよね？",
      "source_fingerprint": "97827952cb8548014d5bccf85be889af9ec7f2b249a660cf813b4d67048b7bed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abc4df3f10aa419a135ce523",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节，快乐……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f14bd99f4b61734a62b52cc1ca27b2d609a659b9de812ffaaf5079c5712dfbf7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:310e66da56b7448e064d8276",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピー、バレンタイン……",
      "source_fingerprint": "48c530cb51953744d793f8a8708d71ce1db23b55799e183d91e1fd1bcf721c8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc3f9d2beeaa6a5c6659861a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "爸爸说累的时候就要吃甜食，\r\n所以要吃黑糖红豆馅蜜。\r\n但我也想吃圣代或蛋糕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aba163dc1b47239e9aa66cd05a30bfd33a9b8737207ef05732f529e92df35bc0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b48f2f81bcf649fea1b5bd32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我尊敬的对象？当然是祖母！\r\n她是伟大的魔女，\r\n而且总是温柔地对我展露笑容！",
      "source_fingerprint": "447edd1abcbdc5c78952583d8f42019af5453a7445a676bf96694cfb1b9a3267",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e95cf77638ad3e47f9f4189",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "北部总是替周围的人\r\n带来许多欢笑。\r\n她有成为一个好魔女的资质！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42320308c83dfe57326b4779a37513d45e3b6b6540a72b664dd9ffe213252d85",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75b3693b694f85f811cad480",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我每次想熬夜时，\r\n都会被富士阻挠！\r\n明明有些魔法只能在晚上用～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed50f85edac53c55327987daea1a2be6690f27f79c80d5f1fa3567e3463148d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7790c5594f40bc1b2ddd4443",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我不想早起，\r\n但这个星期天是特例！\r\n我要和川上一起去看公主战士♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f84f81491a5b3b3055d55a883d6ccecdc065e7df0a5d6bed115092f56b474703",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ef57d875131a45782c62a0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Sweepy的演唱会果然\r\n也要很开心才行！我要向大家\r\n展现魔法，炒热气氛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21c24b8e9411d8aaa2584508617941c3f98274162ede21d67161e628a3af38f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9e3dce4bbd24efb4b8ebeb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祖母的演唱会也很厉害！\r\n既闪亮又耀眼！\r\n光是看影片就能感觉到很强的魔力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bd5831dc8e924a6538603210aed6251055f2f5009273968c4c7264f5c9b14dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f7c8324d53445502c97edda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼，我离伟大的魔女\r\n又更近一步了！Sweepy在获得\r\n决胜服后已经无所畏惧了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cde75bd407eb67aa2bb6039528a29d6e2f87c69da86e9760674530292f54627b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68572a1af2467c7a5150d524",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "获得专属于我的决胜服后，\r\n就轮到专属于我的魔法了！\r\n我绝对要想出厉害的魔法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77aea78e22ce18e9da4bac115b4587444df6e3a6e754782a20fc62f8fa69b3f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac223b0871d0add707696ba7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "使魔，背我去教室！\r\nSweepy早上很难清醒，\r\n你要好好照顾我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03aa6a3355106b323173df32c996f179a44a0ece7bf6e673efda01919796c26c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:268c11ad5804fd0038036755",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我说不吃就是不吃！只有青椒\r\n我绝对不吃！那么苦的东西，\r\n怎么可能吃得下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d223bcb90953b9702a899a1ebad3361c0561c5bb4df5e3805967668125927276",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f58e9cc83e0b6610b2767317",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，去帮我把蝙蝠找回来！\r\n我对它施展了变化魔法，\r\n但后来追丢它了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d05db89b4e047db01733294ccc6c6f6a838eb8aefbf8a9876ff9169a18ec5baa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df78d3e53930072358f975c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花树蕴含着魔力！\r\n我捡到了一根不错的树枝，\r\n回去后要做成魔法杖♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b764a87f0290c86630b9502b56c7ddd29027ce557a947878290755778d4488",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c158b2f73436f9535f1a24e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "头好痛……\r\n看来不能吸取太多冰块的魔力……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f91da86513fd65732d57f95f647dd0499ef24f306d8d52311fb81485985181c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:689ea6b186e50ef41e643e9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次带我一起去爬山吧！\r\n我想采集很多像枫叶和银杏\r\n这些只有现在采得到的材料！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae8606815e0d2507884a3138f6f6a1faee2e3a6b2b51763d1fa0f2601ec8ce3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09aa2a2f4f942700073e9f87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等开始积雪后，\r\n就来盖Sweepy的家吧！\r\n你要先做好准备喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a438fc75e0120bab5fbfebd59d5412701a7f2df258d4ba6d0e2631cbb16898e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a535fe9926926c93cca8a3d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヴィルシーナっていっつもクール\r\nなのに、妹の前だとデレデレなのよ\r\n…どんな魔法をかけられてるの！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e128a30924f30c6a0209c78c5a00f193e77077b4c9168b037fd2052725fdb419",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a6ba41d362beb39d863ddaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…オルフェにこの衣装を見せたら、\r\n『で？余に一体何を求む？』\r\nですって！もー！なんなのアイツ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb7349e6dcced5d16a1cfe553dd70340c18f85dcd9b568db1d1d2ec854b0ef7b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b4fa648e058ee1656047f36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "使い魔～！昨日、どうしてLANE\r\n返さなかったのよ！…また残業！？\r\nもう明日からがんばるの禁止っ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bce9d34356bfb9ca99f7739f64bfb344a7a3680c43dd5cc4d146836697e13b1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:650ea8a9ccb2c6bf88978187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "キングから、キングコールってやつ\r\nを教わったんだけど…あれはなんの\r\n呪文なの？…まさか大魔法っ！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c83c3f947addb2704c36fd6a7e80936c3bd4d51a751752621b75b9784f944b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c91f91b134925c992471f28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシのこの姿を見たら、パパが\r\n泣きだしちゃって…へんなパパ。\r\n泣くんじゃなくてほめなさいよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cdd2187bf09c540b4138b5ea521ac436c6e9862956f360adf46407ff701c1cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50bcc881884aece2aff4a96d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "んぅ…。…あ、ね、寝てないわよ？\r\nそれより、たくさんのケーキは…？\r\nあったでしょ…どこにやったのよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f32d37d030d35a8a6005e6474f8607f857cfd8d0f41a85a0594e9ca1c3e0fe2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfaa4967a7a489431b41b47b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カフェのおばちゃんが、大人は好き\r\n嫌いしないもんだって…大人でも\r\nトマトとか苦手な人いるじゃない！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b65e8ed6cdeb803ee571a710e9f38677e491316237e44249af260bc84f571403",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37aa63ad9849501f994b9be6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "知ってる？お月さまにはすごい\r\nパワーがあるのよ！いまなら、\r\n難しい魔法だって成功するかも♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed72576628ef74fc6ece88c9e1c22d3934e5872068104563b948781c7cac75e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e529099ee2018cd2464711b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プリーザ☆ブルーラ♪桜よ、\r\n永久に咲き続けろ～！…よし。\r\nこれでいつでも、お花見し放題ね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68ba1fd4ac985375bb43eb78e2f09155d10f0a82f4f1b3b0ae3eff976f0a5ac9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3600fb7394c6b2c66d89213",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "かき氷のシロップが、ぜんぶ同じ味\r\nだなんてウソよね？ウソでしょっ？\r\nもしかして魔法がかかってるの！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57944692d5238a993f49a320f0bfc14366b29d0c89f9147b0f97163648a0e332",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1044",
        "91025"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
